Description: LV2 host for MOD Audio devices
 mod-host is an LV2 host for the MOD Audio platform. It loads LV2 plugins,
 connects them via JACK, and provides a TCP control interface. It runs as a
 JACK internal client, managed via the JACK session mechanism.
 .
 This package includes a systemd service for JACK with configurable audio
 device parameters, and a udev rule to auto-start when the configured USB
 audio device is connected.
